FILESIZEBITS		_PC_FILESIZEBITS
LINK_MAX		_PC_LINK_MAX
MAX_CANON		_PC_MAX_CANON
MAX_INPUT		_PC_MAX_INPUT
NAME_MAX		_PC_NAME_MAX
PATH_MAX		_PC_PATH_MAX
PIPE_BUF		_PC_PIPE_BUF
SYMLINK_MAX		_PC_SYMLINK_MAX
_POSIX_TIMESTAMP_RESOLUTION	_PC_TIMESTAMP_RESOLUTION


1. pathconf constants — per-file/filesystem limits queried via pathconf() / fpathconf()
2. sysconf constants — system-wide limits/options queried via sysconf()

pathconf_constants.h	Maps all PC_* token aliases + platform detection + pathconf_print() helper
sysconf_constants.h	Maps all SC_* token aliases across limits, POSIX flags, and XSI flags + sysconf_print() helper
standards_demo.c	Self-contained CLI probe: calls every constant on a user-specified path and prints results